{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4nFRHQ4yLKmoMqnBne","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, unassuming door. Wooden. Old. The grain runs vertically, darkened by years. A single brass keyhole sits at my center, tarnished green at the edges.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide in. Cool metal teeth catching against my tumblers, one by one.*\n\n**click**\n\n**click**\n\n**click**\n\n*A deep, resonant thunk echoes from within my frame.*\n\n*I drift open — slowly — hinges groaning a sound like a long-held breath finally released.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you had forgotten existed. The air that passes through is neither warm nor cold. It smells of dust and possibility. A single light flickers at the far end.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":189,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}